{%- comment -%}
  The product price line: optional "From" prefix, then the price, then a
  struck compare-at. Renders inline — wrap it in the card or PDP price
  element. One rule lives here: the struck compare renders only when
  neither price varies across variants, because a struck range is a lie.

  Accepts:
  - product (required)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign price_on_sale = false
  if product.price_varies == false and product.compare_at_price_varies == false and product.compare_at_price > product.price
    assign price_on_sale = true
  endif
-%}
{%- if product.price_varies %}From {% endif -%}{{ product.price | money }}
{%- if price_on_sale %} <s class="sl-price-compare">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</s>{% endif -%}
